-- M1 COMBOS ----------------------------------------------------------------
-- Every hit is anticipation (a load-up that sinks and twists the hips), a
-- snap into the strike, a held contact frame (lengthened by hitstop when it
-- connects) and a recovery. Hips turn and shift the whole body so the power
-- comes from the legs, the waist whips on top of that, the neck keeps the
-- eyes on the target, and the free hand stays up to guard.
local SNAP = Enum.EasingStyle.Quart

